<div class="view"><div class="page-title"><h1>I miei ordini</h1><a class="button primary" href="/amelia3/customers?pick=1">Nuovo ordine</a></div>
<nav class="tabs" aria-label="Ordini"><% { 'DRAFT' => 'Bozze', 'CONFIRMED_LOCAL' => 'Confermati', 'HISTORY' => 'Storico' }.each do |status, label| %><%= link_to label, amelia3_orders_path(status: status), class: @tab == status ? 'active' : nil, aria: { current: @tab == status ? 'page' : nil } %><% end %></nav>
<% if @tab == 'HISTORY' %><%= render 'amelia3/components/history_orders' %><% else %>
<p>Gli ordini confermati sono salvati localmente. Nessuna trasmissione al gestionale.</p><div class="scroll-area" data-kind="list" aria-label="Ordini locali"><%= render 'amelia3/components/order_rows', orders: @orders %></div><%= amelia_pagination(@total) %>
<% end %></div>
